{
  "slug": "perception-first-design",
  "name": "Perception First Design",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Perception-First Design (PFD) — psychology-backed design framework. 5-layer dependency stack derives requirements from cognitive constraints before proposing solutions. Auto-activates on design, marketing, copywriting, and communication tasks.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **4 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `pfd` (This skill should be used when working on any design, marketing, copywriting, writing, or communication task — including:…)\n- **Commands** (4): `all` (Run all three PFD modes (analyze, solve, evaluate) on the same input), `analyze` (Analyze a hypothetical change, mechanism, or behavioral pattern with Perception-First Design), `evaluate` (Evaluate an artifact (URL, HTML, screenshot, copy) with Perception-First Design), `solve` (Solve a design, marketing, writing, or communication problem with Perception-First Design)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install perception-first-design@claude-community` from `skovalik/perception-first-design`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "command": 4
  },
